        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan claps in Lang Ya blessed land and a large amount of cloud fog appears and rapidly expands. The power of the sword has no form or limits. It cannot be intercepted, and without any solid matter it cannot be resisted. Of the five sword path killer moves he has finished modifying, this is one of the four that came from Bo Qing rather than from Lang Ya Sect. Sword path sits below wisdom path for him: fewer Immortal Gu, far lower attainment, limited modification, and power about the same as Bo Qing’s original version.",
      "chapters": [
        1468
      ],
